      <p class="eyebrow">Residential Outdoor · Smoker Brands · LA Estates + Coast · Same Day</p>
      <h1>Outdoor Smoker Brands We Service in LA</h1>
      <p class="hub-lede">Backyard smokers are an LA outdoor-living category increasingly common in Calabasas, Hidden Hills, Bel Air, and the broader luxury-residential outdoor-kitchen segment. Five brands cover most service: Big Green Egg (the ceramic kamado benchmark with lifetime ceramic warranty), Kamado Joe (premium ceramic kamado tier), Primo (US-made oval ceramic), Traeger (pellet smoker with WiFIRE connectivity — Pro, Ironwood, Timberline series), and Memphis (pellet smoker premium tier — Pro Elite, Beale Street, Advantage).</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
