      <h2>5 outdoor smoker brands we work on</h2>
      <p><strong>When a backyard smoker fails at an LA-area home, our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair trace it to a handful of patterns: on ceramic kamados (Big Green Egg, Kamado Joe, Primo) it's gasket replacement (year 3-5, $145-$245), dome-thermometer accuracy ($85-$145 if replacement is needed), and hardware service (hinges, bands, dampers), with ceramic damage navigated through warranty; on pellet smokers (Traeger, Memphis) it's auger-motor service, igniter replacement (year 2-4), controller diagnostics, and WiFi-connectivity troubleshooting on the modern WiFIRE units. Big Green Egg specifically carries a lifetime ceramic warranty our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair help customers access. $89 commercial diagnostic, applied to repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited.</strong></p>
