          <p>Big Green Egg repair across Southern California. Gasket replacement, dome thermometer, ceramic warranty, hardware.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Big Green Egg repair details →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/outdoor/smoker-repair/brands/kamado-joe/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>Kamado Joe</h3>
          <p>Kamado Joe repair across Southern California. Ceramic + electric service trees.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Kamado Joe repair details →</span>
        </a>
